  "body": "at restart, we try to calculate the next generated user id, which requires a table-scan which may take many seconds. If we don't manage to correctly calculate it before the next request turns up, then we end up stuck in a loop where both requests repeatedly get allocated the same user id and we never manage to break out of it",
